Insert a value in the entry.

To get the integer index at which this value will be inserted, use
[`key`] prior to calling `insert`.

# Examples

```
# use sharded_slab::Slab;
let mut slab = Slab::new();

let hello = {
    let entry = slab.vacant_entry().unwrap();
    let key = entry.key();

